# Planning workspace

This directory holds the problem, smallest useful version, evidence, alternatives, and
implementation plan. It does not assume what kind of software or process the project will
deliver.

- `definition.md` records the problem, current approach, value, users, purpose, smallest
  version, exclusions, and success signals.
- `open-questions.md` holds unanswered matters that affect the decision.
- `later.md` keeps useful ideas out of the current version until the author requests them.

Add research, architecture, a build plan, and review evidence only when the current phase
needs them. Record substantive decisions in `governance/decisions.yaml`, and do not enter
Build without explicit author approval.
